          "evidence": "Step 1.2 gives termination and q=0 when m=0.",
          "case": "empty"
        },
        {
          "status": "checked",
          "evidence": "Step 1.3 proves q<=b, hence b=0 forces no query; step 2.1 covers unanimous predictions before a disagreement.",
          "case": "zero"
