      "risk_review": {
        "status": "complete",
        "reviewer": "alpha-batch-100",
        "notes": "Every step independently checked against pool and procedure Definitions and log laws. Exact labels preserve target; each query removes a distinct alternative. Index advance or return proves termination, including m=0; budget induction includes b=0; singleton H admits no query. Branch-size induction gives 1<=rho^q|H|; log(1/rho)>0 gives claimed bound including q=0. No AC or diagram. Published logarithm Proof 3.1 omits normalization citation (reader:100:1); L3 yields t=1/t, t>0, hence exp(0)=1, so consumer remains sound."
