        {
          "id": "derive-1-1",
          "step": "1.1",
          "claim": "If $m=0$, the initialized scan index is $i=1>m$. The loop has no iteration, so the procedure returns the initialized $V=\\mathcal H$ and empty query log.",
          "inputs": [
