        {
          "id": "derive-2-1",
          "step": "2.1",
          "claim": "If $b=0$ for a general class, the query count remains $q=0$ until the first disagreement. At every preceding unanimous index, [F2] records a prediction and advances without a query. At the first disagreement, $q=b$, so [F2] marks that index and the remaining suffix as abstentions and returns; if no disagreement occurs, the scan reaches its end. In either case no oracle query is made.",
          "inputs": [
